# Hybrid (default)

Two sections when using chat output. Stake singles separately.

1. **Singles** — every pick that passes the confidence gate and user odds range. No fixed count — quality over quantity.
2. **Suggested acca (optional)** — legs drawn from the same researched picks when joint probability justifies it. User/UI sets target combined odds.

If nothing qualifies, output zero picks and explain in skipped.

Web app: set `ticket_mode: hybrid` and populate `suggested_tickets`.

Save suffix (chat): `_today.md` or `_tomorrow.md`.
